<title>SOUTH AFRICA: MEDHOLD SLIDES TO HALF YR PRE-EXCEPS LOSS.</title>
<headline>MEDHOLD SLIDES TO HALF YR PRE-EXCEPS LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - pre-exceps	    2.7 loss    vs 4.1 profit</p>
<p>    - post exceps	   2.7 profit  vs 4.1 profit</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.62	  vs 2.37</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   2.71	  vs 3.72</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.06	  vs 1.22</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.13	  vs 1.14</p>
<p>    Turnover		  53.70	 vs 55.28</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     3.253 gain  vs none</p>
<p>Full name: Medhold Ltd </p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said no dividend was declared. The exceptional gain represents compensation received in respect of rationalisation costs.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
